<title>UK: British Gas rise on broker recommendation.</title>
<headline>British Gas rise on broker recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Gas Plc rose on Wednesday as a leading securities house repeated its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation, dealers said.</p>
<p>British Gas shares were up 6p at 198-1/2p by 1627 GMT with dealers saying that UBS has reiterated its positive stance on the stock.</p>
